":"A Fantastic Woman","overview":"Marina's life is thrown into turmoil following the death of her partner. Mourning the loss of the man she loved, she finds herself under intense scrutiny from those with no regard for her privacy.","tagline":"My name is Marina Vidal. Do you have any problem with that?"},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Marina una joven camarera aspirante a cantante y Orlando, veinte años mayor, planean un futuro juntos. Tras una noche de fiesta, Marina lo lleva a urgencias, pero él muere al llegar al hospital. Ella debe entonces enfrentar las sospechas por su muerte. Su condición de mujer transexual supone para la familia de Orlando una completa aberración. Ella tendrá que luchar para convertirse en lo que es: una mujer fuerte, pasional… fantástica.","tagline":"Mi nombres es Marina Vidal, ¿tienen un problema con eso?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eDWJdoUtyjJOqERWBeynPajxcIe.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hnDmX7PwpnrNrAQvYQgYemkS9Fx.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":429191,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eDWJdoUtyjJOqERWBeynPajxcIe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eDWJdoUtyjJOqERWBeynPajxcIe.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eDWJdoUtyjJOqERWBeynPajxcIe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eDWJdoUtyjJOqERWBeynPajxcIe.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jtvKjHCMGoxxGTo6yiAzJ9jKuc2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jtvKjHCMGoxxGTo6yiAzJ9jKuc2.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmd